<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1874801993"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:42.320"><div begin="28.270" end="52.234" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="28.270" end="33.372" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="voice"><span begin="28.270" end="29.398">乱世马</span><span begin="29.398" end="29.711">蹄</span> <span begin="29.711" end="30.583">谁还</span><span begin="30.583" end="31.362">留在</span><span begin="31.362" end="32.311">风雪</span><span begin="32.311" end="33.372">里</span></p><p begin="34.596" end="39.497" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="voice"><span begin="34.596" end="35.779">多少人</span><span begin="35.779" end="36.051">在</span><span begin="36.051" end="36.952">命悬</span><span begin="36.952" end="37.725">一线</span><span begin="37.725" end="38.028">的</span><span begin="38.028" end="38.555">距</span><span begin="38.555" end="39.497">离</span></p><p begin="40.133" end="46.373" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="voice"><span begin="40.133" end="41.162">而家园</span><span begin="41.162" end="41.655">硝</span><span begin="41.655" end="42.450">烟</span><span begin="42.450" end="42.841">起</span> <span begin="43.192" end="43.715">谁</span><span begin="43.715" end="43.957">能</span><span begin="43.957" end="44.298">遗</span><span begin="44.298" end="44.858">世</span><span begin="44.858" end="45.305">独</span><span begin="45.305" end="46.373">立</span></p><p begin="47.104" end="52.234" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="voice"><span begin="47.104" end="48.723">夕阳隐去</span> <span begin="48.723" end="49.629">我无</span><span begin="49.629" end="50.779">语</span> <span begin="50.779" end="52.234">Yeah</span></p></div><div begin="53.468" end="1:18.307" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="53.468" end="59.239" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="voice"><span begin="53.468" end="54.265">秋色</span><span begin="54.265" end="55.047">落地</span> <span begin="55.047" end="55.904">谁轻</span><span begin="55.904" end="56.238">踩</span><span begin="56.238" end="56.725">枫</span><span begin="56.725" end="57.090">叶</span><span begin="57.090" end="57.427">而<